# motion-video-reset (M10): Reset all at real speed. The values typed as motion-reset types them
# (a 2, k 1, b 1.5, h −1), then the recording: Reset all clicked (400, 376 at 1440 x 900), the curve
# springing back on the sweep spring (702 ms), P riding it, the changed terms flashing (600 ms).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 3000
click 383 424
wait 100
type "2"
key Enter
click 383 468
wait 100
type "1"
key Enter
click 383 529
wait 100
type "1.5"
key Enter
click 383 573
wait 100
type "-1"
key Enter
click 760 48
wait 1500
video start reset
wait 300
click 400 376
wait 1500
video stop
